# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Open glossary term SERVICE JUNCTION: 설비 분기점, the room card's word; a reviewer's word. Status and instruction lines use 합니다/하세요; story narration uses the plain 한다 style.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2515
msgid ""
"Service junction restored. The sentry\n"
"is down; pop the exit bolt by the door."
msgstr ""
"설비 분기점이 복구되었습니다. 센트리가 쓰러졌습니다.\n"
"문 옆의 출구 볼트를 해제하세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Open glossary term SERVICE JUNCTION: 설비 분기점, the room card's word; a reviewer's word.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2518
msgid ""
"Service junction restored. The door is\n"
"down. The sentry patrols past the rubble."
msgstr ""
"설비 분기점이 복구되었습니다. 문이 날아갔습니다.\n"
"센트리가 잔해 너머를 순찰합니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The service line is 설비 라인, matching the junction's 설비 분기점.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2524
msgid "The first copy is safe. Use the exit to follow the service line."
msgstr "첫 번째 사본은 안전합니다. 출구로 나가 설비 라인을 따라가세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Records access, the room, is 기록 접근실; a trace is 기록.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2527
msgid "Records access restored. Both traces are copied; head for the exit."
msgstr "기록 접근실이 복구되었습니다. 두 기록을 모두 복사했습니다. 출구로 가세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2530
msgid "Records access restored. The purge order is copied; copy the mirror index next."
msgstr "기록 접근실이 복구되었습니다. 퍼지 명령을 복사했습니다. 다음은 미러 색인을 복사하세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2533
msgid "Records access restored. Copy the purge-order trace first; WOLF is checking the mirror."
msgstr "기록 접근실이 복구되었습니다. 먼저 퍼지 명령 기록을 복사하세요. WOLF가 미러를 확인하고 있습니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2537
msgid "Safe point restored."
msgstr "안전 지점이 복구되었습니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The Director's purge display, read as a speaker; WOLF answers in the next message. A machine display's terse wording.
#. i18n: story speaker=DIRECTOR
#: scripts/main.gd:2568
msgid "Original program logs marked for deletion."
msgstr "원본 프로그램 로그: 삭제 대상으로 지정됨."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2570
msgid "They want the source record gone. We need to preserve it."
msgstr "저들은 원본 기록을 없애려 해. 우리가 지켜야 해."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2581
msgid "No station in reach. Follow the labeled breaker, relay, bypass or safe point."
msgstr "닿는 곳에 스테이션이 없습니다. 표시된 차단기, 릴레이, 바이패스, 안전 지점을 찾아가세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2622
msgid "Power is already on. The relay is farther down the hall."
msgstr "전원은 이미 켜져 있습니다. 릴레이는 복도 더 안쪽에 있습니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF thanks the engineer for telling him the relay's risk. Avoid a past tense that shows the engineer's gender ("you told me"). Arm the breaker: 차단기를 올리다, the everyday Korean for switching a breaker on.
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2635
msgid "Thank you for telling me. I'll take the relay. Arm the breaker."
msgstr "말해 줘서 고마워. 릴레이는 내가 맡을게. 차단기를 올려."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2639
msgid "No. I won't take that risk blind. Use the manual bypass."
msgstr "아니. 모르는 채로 그런 위험은 안 져. 수동 바이패스를 써."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2652
msgid "The relay is dark. Arm the breaker first."
msgstr "릴레이가 꺼져 있습니다. 먼저 차단기를 올리세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The seal (the red sealed door) is 봉인문 everywhere.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2656
#: scripts/main.gd:2699
msgid "The seal is open. The safe point is just beyond it."
msgstr "봉인문이 열렸습니다. 안전 지점은 바로 그 너머입니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2662
msgid "I said no. I won't touch it blind. The bypass is right beside it."
msgstr "싫다고 했잖아. 모르는 채로는 안 건드려. 바이패스가 바로 옆에 있어."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2674
msgid "I've got the contact. Give me a moment."
msgstr "접점은 내가 잡았어. 잠깐만."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2686
msgid "WOLF takes the surge through the live contact. The red seal opens."
msgstr "WOLF가 전류가 흐르는 접점으로 서지를 받아 낸다. 붉은 봉인문이 열린다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2702
msgid "The bypass handle won't move. The breaker has to be on first."
msgstr "바이패스 손잡이가 움직이지 않습니다. 먼저 차단기를 올려야 합니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2759
msgid "The bypass locks over and the alarm cuts out. The red seal opens."
msgstr "바이패스가 넘어가 고정되고 경보가 멎는다. 붉은 봉인문이 열린다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2761
msgid "Open. I'm with you."
msgstr "열렸어. 함께 갈게."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2772
msgid "The safe point is past the sealed door."
msgstr "안전 지점은 봉인문 너머에 있습니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF, after the engineer pressed him at the relay without warning.
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2786
msgid "I refused the live relay; I'm still here."
msgstr "전기가 흐르는 릴레이는 거절했어. 그래도 난 여기 있어."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF to the engineer, who told him the relay's risk. Avoid a past tense that shows the engineer's gender ("you told me").
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2789
msgid "I took the relay because you told me the truth."
msgstr "네가 사실을 말해 줬으니까 릴레이를 맡았어."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF to the engineer, who cranked the manual bypass after he offered to take the relay. Avoid a past tense that shows the engineer's gender ("you cranked").
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2792
msgid "I offered the relay; you cranked the bypass. Still with you."
msgstr "난 릴레이를 맡겠다고 했고, 넌 바이패스를 돌렸지. 그래도 함께야."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Purge is 퍼지 throughout (queue, order, display), so the deletion order (삭제 명령) stays a different word.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2795
msgid "Take the purge queue. I'll inspect the mirror."
msgstr "퍼지 대기열은 네가 맡아. 난 미러를 살펴볼게."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). %s is the key or button. No particle after the slot that changes with its last sound (slot_particles): the key is left without 을/를, as Korean prompts often write it.
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you slot=key
#: scripts/main.gd:2804
msgid "The safe point could not save. Press %s here again."
msgstr "안전 지점에서 저장하지 못했습니다. 여기서 다시 %s 누르세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps). The touch form; USE is the touch button's word (USAR).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2804
msgid "The safe point could not save. Tap USE here again."
msgstr "안전 지점에서 저장하지 못했습니다. 여기서 “사용”을 다시 탭하세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2815
msgid "Safe point saved."
