msgstr "안전 지점에 저장했습니다. WOLF도 같은 선택을 기억합니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the engineer's first name. No particle after the slot that changes with its last sound (slot_particles): 에게 (to), so the copy stays with the engineer.
#. i18n: story speaker=narrator engineer=name
#: scripts/main.gd:2827
msgid "The Director's purge order has a time and target ID. %s keeps a local copy; the original logs are still missing."
msgstr "소장의 퍼지 명령에는 시각과 대상 ID가 있다. 로컬 사본 하나가 %s에게 남는다. 원본 로그는 여전히 없다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2830
msgid "The purge-order trace is already copied. The mirror port may confirm when the source existed."
msgstr "퍼지 명령 기록은 이미 복사했습니다. 미러 포트에서 원본이 언제 존재했는지 확인할 수 있을지도 모릅니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2836
msgid "The mirror index has no context yet. Copy the purge-order trace first."
msgstr "미러 색인만으로는 아직 맥락이 없습니다. 먼저 퍼지 명령 기록을 복사하세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2839
msgid "The mirror timestamp is already preserved. The exit is to the right."
msgstr "미러 타임스탬프는 이미 보존했습니다. 출구는 오른쪽입니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF's readout is 판독 화면, as in the answer USE WOLF'S READOUT.
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/main.gd:2848
msgid "I found the mirror index. We can use my readout or your maintenance port."
msgstr "미러 색인을 찾았어. 내 판독 화면을 쓰거나 네 정비 포트를 쓰면 돼."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:2877
msgid "Exit sealed until the purge order and mirror timestamp are copied."
msgstr "퍼지 명령과 미러 타임스탬프를 복사할 때까지 출구는 봉쇄됩니다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2914
#: scripts/main.gd:5377
msgid "Mirror copied. Head for the exit."
msgstr "미러 복사 완료. 출구로 가세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2916
msgid "Follow the station lights: mirror port, then exit."
msgstr "스테이션 불빛을 따라가세요: 미러 포트, 그다음 출구."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: Hint bar (14 px, about 526 px wide on a keyboard and 488 px on touch; wraps).
#. i18n: speaker=hint engineer=you
#: scripts/main.gd:2917
msgid "Follow the station lights: purge queue, mirror port, then exit."
msgstr "스테이션 불빛을 따라가세요: 퍼지 대기열, 미러 포트, 그다음 출구."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF's line in the dialogue box (after the WOLF: tag). %s is the second answer's key or button. No particle after the slot that changes with its last sound (slot_particles): the key is left without 을/를.
#. TRANSLATORS: WOLF, still walking to the mirror. %s is the key or button for the manual port.
#. i18n: story speaker=WOLF slot=key
#: scripts/main.gd:3133
msgid "I'm still checking the drive. Wait for me, or press %s for the manual port."
msgstr "아직 드라이브를 확인하는 중이야. 기다리든지, %s 눌러서 수동 포트를 써."

