msgstr "아직 드라이브를 확인하는 중이야. 기다리든지, “수동 포트 사용”을 탭해."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=narrator
#: scripts/main.gd:3148
msgid "WOLF reads the timestamp off his own readout. The purge target existed before the deletion order."
msgstr "WOLF가 자기 판독 화면에서 타임스탬프를 읽는다. 퍼지 대상은 삭제 명령보다 먼저 존재했다."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: %s is the engineer's first name. No particle after the slot that changes with its last sound (slot_particles): 의 (copying the timestamp is %s's job): a clause ending on the bare name read back as unfinished.
