# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: i18n: story speaker=WOLF
#: scripts/story_text.gd:105
msgid "An order and a timestamp don't tell me who's a threat. I want the source."
msgstr "명령 하나와 타임스탬프로는 누가 위협인지 알 수 없어. 원본이 필요해."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The engineer answers WOLF (their name stands over the line). Archive is the next place.
#. i18n: story speaker=engineer engineer=self
#: scripts/story_text.gd:108
msgid "Then Archive is next."
msgstr "그럼 다음은 아카이브야."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The engineer, entering the junction (their name stands over the line).
#. i18n: story speaker=engineer engineer=self
#: scripts/story_text.gd:112
msgid "That door is our way through."
msgstr "저 문이 우리가 지나갈 길이야."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: The engineer names the next step when the player stalls (their name stands over the line).
#. i18n: story speaker=engineer engineer=self
#: scripts/story_text.gd:115
msgid ""
"The breaker by the entrance\n"
