"Stay close to the TANK RELEASE."
msgstr ""
"센트리가 탁 트인 곳에서 %s의 모습을 포착했다.\n"
"탱크 투하 가까이에 있으세요."

# machine-translated by Claude (Anthropic), unreviewed
#. TRANSLATORS: A knockdown card. %s is the engineer's first name, as an object: keep the name in the nominative (no case ending), and no gendered words about them. No particle after the slot that changes with its last sound (slot_particles): 의 (ran after %s and caught up).
